  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Stop animation <b>anim</b> for agent that granted <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_TRIGGER_ANIMATION" target="_blank">PERMISSION_TRIGGER_ANIMATION</a> if the permission has not been revoked.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Animation / anim</td>
          <td>an animation in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of an animation&#32;or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Internal_Animations" target="_blank">built in animation</a> name</td>
        </tr>
